TEXT -1552 -240 Left 2 ;Experiment 6(a): 4:1 Multiplexer using CMOS Transmission Gates
TEXT -1552 -192 Left 1 ;Y = S1'.S0'.I0 + S1'.S0.I1 + S1.S0'.I2 + S1.S0.I3   (S0 = LSB selects inside each pair, S1 = MSB selects the pair)
TEXT -1552 1600 Left 2 !.tran 0 40m 0 10u
TEXT -1552 1648 Left 1 ;Plot V(s1), V(s0), V(i0)..V(i3), V(output).  0-10ms: S1S0=00 -> I0 (fast square) | 10-20ms: 01 -> I1 (slower square) |
TEXT -1552 1680 Left 1 ;20-30ms: 10 -> I2 (one 5 ms pulse) | 30-40ms: 11 -> I3 (constant HIGH).  NMOS body -> GND, PMOS body -> VDD.
